{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-32","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平行六面体与平行线","englishTitle":"Parallelepipedal solids which are of the same height are to one another as their bases.","book":11,"number":32,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.32","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.32/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":32,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-32@raw-bfd5c29ba934286e","contentId":"euclid-11-32","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bfd5c29ba934286eaebc6c34f2e1534915f207d2f36d8f690a13141b5f6f57be","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-32.statement","euclid-11-32.construction.1","euclid-11-32.construction.2","euclid-11-32.proof.1","euclid-11-32.proof.2","euclid-11-32.proof.3","euclid-11-32.conclusion","euclid-11-32.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-32.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-32","revisionId":"euclid-11-32@raw-bfd5c29ba934286e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"293d0027cc50645eb7fb7a39f8f988e927eb688b142110a2defdcb3e4e0a3e17","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Parallelepipedal solids which are of the same height are to one another as their bases."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平行管道的固体与它们的底边一样高。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-32.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-32","revisionId":"euclid-11-32@raw-bfd5c29ba934286e","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e03612c2cf523c9f936ebdb305549cfb3f92304950461e2173a4881a9aab8a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, CD be parallelepipedal solids of the same height; I say that the parallelepipedal solids AB, CD are to one another as their bases, that is, that, as the base AE is to the base CF, so is the solid AB to the solid CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让同一高度的AB、CD平行管道固体;我说,平行管道固体AB、CD是它们底边个的,也就是说,底边 AE和底边 CF的比例等于固体AB和CD"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-32.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-32","revisionId":"euclid-11-32@raw-bfd5c29ba934286e","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"15df2bca632eec44a899f0e5487dcac802eadd184b0b70da90fc661c50124922","citations":["euclid-1-45"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let FH equal to AE be applied to FG, [[I. 45](/principles/euclid-1-45)] and on FH as base, and with the same height as that of CD, let the parallelepipedal solid GK be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FH等于AE的装置适用于FG,FH等于底边,高度与CD相同,完成平行管道固体GK。 [[I. 45](/principles/euclid-1-45)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-32.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-32","revisionId":"euclid-11-32@raw-bfd5c29ba934286e","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e7a77bf3f4a95a7055b7ccea3757d0b0f951c9a34d3bd88b1053efe1d2cbe4f0","citations":["euclid-11-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then the solid AB is equal to the solid GK; for they are on equal bases AE, FH and of the same height. [[XI. 31](/principles/euclid-11-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"固体AB等于固体GK; 因为它们等于底边 AE, FH, 同一高度。 [[XI. 31](/principles/euclid-11-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-32.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-32","revisionId":"euclid-11-32@raw-bfd5c29ba934286e","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8cd3bde40137e9433b04ba02cc2339df2e17300a64dd67ed15286464d711756","citations":["euclid-11-25"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the parallelepipedal solid CK is cut by the plane DG which is parallel to opposite planes, therefore, as the base CF is to the base FH, so is the solid CD to the solid DH. [[XI. 25](/principles/euclid-11-25)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于平行管道固体CK被平面 DG截断,与对面平面截断,因此,底边 CF对底边 FH的比例等于固体CD对固体DH的比例 [[XI. 25](/principles/euclid-11-25)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-32.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-32","revisionId":"euclid-11-32@raw-bfd5c29ba934286e","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"758902d86e39fe934b280788ddbe1dabac2ae5d6ade76687d23510b4ac00985b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the base FH is equal to the base AE, and the solid GK to the solid AB; therefore also, as the base AE is to the base CF, so is the solid AB to the solid CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,底边 FH等于底边 AE,GK固体等于AB固体;因此,底边 AE与底边 CF的比等于AB固体与CD固体的比"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-32.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-32","revisionId":"euclid-11-32@raw-bfd5c29ba934286e","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-32.source","contentId":"euclid-11-32","revisionId":"euclid-11-32@raw-bfd5c29ba934286e","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"116f6c426740ec400dca56d0dd9d125ad0facf5db09f2ee79f12ad967884c8e1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.32/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.32\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-32:euclid-1-45:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-32.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-45","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"I. 45"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-32:euclid-11-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-32.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"XI. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-32:euclid-11-25:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-32.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-25","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn: